Modifications
-------------
This is a modified version of the TRS Launcher website. On 2026-10-27 PwiePixel made these changes
(the full list is in the Git history of this repository):
- New name (Cubiq Launcher, Cubiq Client) and logo; texts rewritten for Cubiq, without statements
  about the original author or project.
- New design in the green of the Cubiq logo (as in Cubiq Launcher) instead of the redstone look:
  colours, Inter font, background scene, mail look, update banners, social preview image.
- Domains, operator data (imprint, privacy policy) and keys are no longer built in – they are set
  per server in .env (SITE_URL, NUXT_PUBLIC_OPERATOR_*, …).
- Removed: the personal music video on the creator dashboard, the redstone background scene,
  infrastructure details of the original operator and screenshots that showed the original
  product; the update signature key is replaced with Cubiq Launcher's own public key.
- Wire formats changed to Cubiq (pack codes CBQ-…, tokens cubiq_…, deep links cubiq-launcher://).
Files that carry the original copyright header keep it.

